{"id":72198,"date":"2026-11-02T08:23:47","date_gmt":"2026-11-02T08:23:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72198"},"modified":"2026-11-02T09:27:16","modified_gmt":"2026-11-02T08:27:16","slug":"insua-nature-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/insua-nature-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"2\u00aa Insua Nature Trail 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">2\u00aa Insua Nature Trail 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>2\u00aa Insua Nature Trail 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>18 de Abril de 2027<\/strong>, com partida agendada para as <strong>09:00<\/strong> em <strong>Penalva do Castelo<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>. Na sua segunda edi\u00e7\u00e3o, a prova regressa aos trilhos da sub-regi\u00e3o de Viseu D\u00e3o Laf\u00f5es com um programa completo que integra <strong>Trail Longo<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Curto<\/strong>, <strong>Mini Trail<\/strong> e <strong>Caminhada<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Desenhado na envolvente natural da freguesia de <strong>\u00cdnsua<\/strong> e do concelho de <strong>Penalva do Castelo<\/strong> \u2014 territ\u00f3rio atravessado pelo vale do rio D\u00e3o e pelos seus afluentes, pontuado por quintas hist\u00f3ricas como a Casa da \u00cdnsua, bosques aut\u00f3ctones e caminhos rurais \u2014, o evento proporciona percursos adaptados tanto a atletas experientes de corrida de montanha como a iniciantes e caminhantes que pretendam descobrir o patrim\u00f3nio paisag\u00edstico penalvense na primavera.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>Junta de Freguesia de \u00cdnsua<\/strong>, promovendo o desporto de natureza e a valoriza\u00e7\u00e3o dos trilhos do concelho de Penalva do Castelo. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"