n-top: 12px;\">O 2\u00aa Insua Nature Trail 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 18 de Abril de 2027, \u00e0s 09:00, em Penalva do Castelo, no distrito de Viseu.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as provas e modalidades dispon\u00edveis na edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 composto por quatro vertentes: Trail Longo, Trail Curto, Mini Trail e Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e o prazo limite de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e pagamentos decorrem at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23:59 de ter\u00e7a-feira, 13 de Abril de 2027, com os seguintes valores: Trail Longo (15,00 \u20ac), Trail Curto (13,00 \u20ac), Mini Trail (12,00 \u20ac) e Caminhada (10,00 \u20ac). Existe ainda op\u00e7\u00e3o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para acompanhantes (7,00 \u20ac).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade respons\u00e1vel pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o da prova est\u00e1 a cargo da Junta de Freguesia de \u00cdnsua (Penalva do Castelo).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O regulamento detalhado com as quilometragens e altimetrias de 2027 j\u00e1 est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A data oficial (18 de Abril de 2027), as quatro vertentes e a tabela de pre\u00e7os j\u00e1 est\u00e3o confirmadas e com inscri\u00e7\u00f5es abertas; o regulamento definitivo com os mapas GPX, dist\u00e2ncias exatas e altimetria detalhada da 2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o ser\u00e1 divulgado pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o antes da prova. Enquanto preparas a \u00e9poca, consulta o nosso <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\">Calend\u00e1rio de Trail em Portugal<\/a>.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"2\u00aa Insua Nature Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-18\", \"endDate\": \"2027-04-18\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Penalva do Castelo\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Penalva do Castelo\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viseu\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O 2\u00aa Insua Nature Trail 2027 realiza-se a 18 de abril em Penalva do Castelo (Viseu). Provas de Trail Longo, Tra